              "message": "Merge pull request #5637 from RiceDee/fix/format-text-fields-fit-pane\n\nfix(ui): Format text fields read as fields, line up, and fit the Tools pane (#5634)",
              "url": "https://github.com/Blenux/pdfcraft/commit/52574b4fe5c1847ff95324fbe47187fac5d2da4e",
              "date": "2026-11-02T13:45:46Z"
