              "message": "lint: drop blank lines after doc comments and attributes; tidy IME else, closure, shell tests (#9576)\n\n- Remove blank lines between doc comments or #[test] attributes and the item (S8855, S8856)\n- type_tool: drop the redundant else after continue in the IME event arm (S8862)\n- ui_state: pass OsStr::to_os_string instead of an equivalent closure (S1612)\n- macos packaging: [[ ]] for the attempt test (S7688); bind validate_staple's argument to a local (S7679)",
